<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">description: &quot;Pricing friction, spawned (free, freq 5): users hit the export-is-Pro-only paywall (~769 hits/580 users), the cleanest Free-&gt;Pro trigger. Upgrade gate shipped.&quot;</span></span>
